From 402170ea09fad226518e158195b95a6c9c9fcbef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 12:54:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat: lyrics on the lock screen's cover, in place of the
 animated artwork

A switch under Mod Settings > Lyrics and the Lock screen widget page makes the lock screen's artwork a card of the
line being sung with the one before and after, over the blurred cover, drawn again on each line. The animated artwork
is not sent while it is on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
